
# 2025-11-22 16:57:41.758147
+Code the following app
+```
+Create a very simple game called Block Grid.
+
+Show a 3x3 grid of empty squares.
+
+When the user taps on a square:
+- if the square is empty, place a block emoji 🟦 in that square
+- if the square already has a block, do nothing
+
+After each tap, check the grid:
+- if any row, column or diagonal has 3 blocks in a line, show the text "Line complete!" and then clear the whole grid back to empty
+
+Keep the layout very simple:
+- the 3x3 grid in the center
+- no timers, no movement, no animations
+- only taps on squares and the "Line complete!" message when there is a full line.
+
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

